# Undead Knight — an Aggro enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 2/12 Aggro enemies — 12 life, bribe 40 gold
# enemy: Undead Knight (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0016.dck "Undead Knight (Bl, 4th Edition)" [Tier 3 —
#   Manalink 3 file dated 2016-02-15; its first 15 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 12
#   lines (60 cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/undead_knight.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 2)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/undead_knight.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Aggro) — "Undead Knight" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Undead Knight
